{"unit_id":"perlied03__dsh-approval-auto-review#card-zh","repo":"perlied03/dsh-approval-auto-review","commit":"afb79a77e71507b0edc6f61b7795b926dc65f035","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-auto-review（DSH Web 插件）：为配置的审批请求提供 Guardian 自动复核。它把 reviewer 接入 DSH 审批流程，可复用 Guardian 会话并在繁忙时启动独立复核；支持按父模型覆盖 reviewer 路由、限制输入长度、记录 JSONL 审计结果，并在 Web 设置中配置模型、在会话中查看复核记录。适合希望为 DSH 审批流程增加自动判定和记录查看的用户。需宿主提供 agent、session、approval、subagent 等服务及配置的 provider。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:328-379","src/guardian.ts:1-2","src/client/index.tsx:34-74"]}
